@PLUGIN@
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
newton on
read_data @DATA@
@PAIR@
pair_coeff * * @MODEL@ @ELEMENTS@
neighbor 0.5 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
velocity all create 300 781239 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix integrate all nve
timestep 0.001
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step pe ke etotal press
run @WARMUP@
reset_timestep 0
run @STEPS@
